    "name": "Spatio-Agri Precision Fertilizer Manager API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for testing the Spatio-Agri Precision Fertilizer Management Backend API, including Health Checks, Farmer & Pilot Registration, Role-Verified Login, and Authenticated User Profiles.",
